## SQ-LGM-01 | Large Meals member loads (LGM-01)
@group A
@commands Boot; `grep -nE "largemeals\|Large Meals\|Item is not food\|Error occurred while handling event" logs/latest.log \| head -30`; `grep -c "Error" logs/kubejs/server.log`
@pass members line lists `largemeals`; `Large Meals upstream assets: N files`; no `Item is not food: largemeals:`; no KubeJS recipe errors naming largemeals
@fails missing dict key, jar missing/sha1 (LGM-01)
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] members: \[.*\blargemeals\b
bootexpect Found new data pack largemeals_upstream_data
bootreject Item is not food: largemeals:
kjsreject (?i)(error|exception).*largemeals

