## SQ-LGM-03 | Potato Soup: with a bowl it comes out, without one the pot keeps it (pots 180, 183)
@group A
@commands Place a Cooking Pot over a campfire, insert 2 potato, onion, milk bucket, bowl; wait 200 ticks
@pass Potato Soup out, bowl consumed; without a bowl the pot holds the meal (LGM-03)
@fails recipe/container
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
# r1120lr batch fault: x 180-210 z 500 was not loaded ('That position is not loaded' / verb=kill error=unloaded); the row loads its own chunks
> forceload add 175 495 215 510
sleep 3
> setblock 180 -60 500 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> setblock 180 -59 500 farmersdelight:cooking_pot
> data merge block 180 -59 500 {Inventory:{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:potato",Count:1b},{Slot:1b,id:"minecraft:potato",Count:1b},{Slot:2b,id:"farmersdelight:onion",Count:1b},{Slot:3b,id:"minecraft:milk_bucket",Count:1b},{Slot:7b,id:"minecraft:bowl",Count:1b}]}}
> setblock 183 -60 500 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> setblock 183 -59 500 farmersdelight:cooking_pot
> data merge block 183 -59 500 {Inventory:{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:potato",Count:1b},{Slot:1b,id:"minecraft:potato",Count:1b},{Slot:2b,id:"farmersdelight:onion",Count:1b},{Slot:3b,id:"minecraft:milk_bucket",Count:1b}]}}
sleep 25
> data get block 180 -59 500 Inventory
> data get block 183 -59 500 Inventory
expect Slot: 8b?, id: "largemeals:potato_soup"
expect Slot: 6b?, id: "largemeals:potato_soup"
reject Slot: 7b?, id: "minecraft:bowl"

